<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 120 bln yen 0.9 pct 2-year notes.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 120 bln yen 0.9 pct 2-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Friday that it was offering 120 billion yen worth of 0.9 percent two-year notes through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be October 21 and maturity date will be October 20, 1998. -- Tokyo Treasury Desk (813-3432-8676)</p>
